<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="TVM5.9.9">
<l>kaḻalvaḷai pūrippayāṅ kaṇṭukaitoḻak kūṭuṅkolō</l>
<l>kuḻaleṉṉa yāḻumeṉṉak kuḷircōlaiyu ṭēṉarunti</l>
<l>maḻalai varivaṇṭuka ḷicaipāṭun tiruvallavāḻ</l>
<l>cuḻaliṉ malicakkarap perumāṉatu tollaruḷē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>Is it possible for us to see, in order fill [again our] loosening bangles, [and] to join [our] hands in worship,</l>
<l>the old grace of the great lord with the discus swift in spinning</l>
<l>of Tiruvallavāḻ, where the humming striped bees sing musically,</l>
<l>having eaten honey in the cool groves, like flutes [or] like lutes?</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
